acing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksaround\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Around</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.20.8834<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 29, 2019<br/>Summer Update 2019</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20220507012242&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adult_Goanna_ca8937.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an adult goanna.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Ksss!</li><li>Hiss!</li><li>Tsss!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Goannas are large predatory lizards with sharp teeth and claws. They have thick skin with camouflage that ranges from bands and stripes to speckles and circles. The skin colour changes as the creatures mature, with juveniles being blue and adult animals being bright red. Goannas lay eggs in a nest or burrow, but sometimes also inside termite mounds, which offers protection as well as incubation. Additionally, the termites provide a meal for the young as they hatch. Goanna eggs are a sought after meal for the human population of Kilmaresh. But as getting them is a dangerous task, they make a rather expensive menu.<br/>Goannas are found throughout the steppes of Kilmaresh. They prey on insects, smaller lizards, snakes, birds, mammals and also humans if they have the chance to do so. But they are also eaters of carrion and thus attracted to rotting meat. There's a debate whether goannas are venomous or not. It is a fact that goanna bites cause incessant bleeding and many sages assume that this is because of toxin-producing glands in the lizards' mouth.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>They are an adult version of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Young%20Goanna\">Young Goanna</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-326? and <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> starting up to 19 hp/turn)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Earth Missile</span> (0-560+; from 2-3 squares distance)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Adult Goanna</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20220507012242&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adult_Goanna_ca8937.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"100\" data-vert=\"100\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181005132408&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=4\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Missile_Appearance_7daa04.gif\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"target\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"eff